<title>USA: EIA says weekly U.S. oil/products data delayed.</title>
<headline>EIA says weekly U.S. oil/products data delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Energy Information Administration's weekly crude oil and products stocks data, scheduled for release at 9 a.m. (1300 GMT), were delayed due to a &quot;data problem,&quot; an EIA spokesman said Wednesday.</p>
<p>He gave no time for the likely release of the data.</p>
